        "title": "Refactor UI tests Helper",
        "short_description": "codeceptjs-resemblehelper is a CodeceptJS helper which integrates the resemble.js functionality of image comparison in tests used to compare...",
        "description": "<p>codeceptjs-resemblehelper is a CodeceptJS helper which integrates the resemble.js functionality of image comparison in tests used to compare images/screenshots and pass/fail tests based on the tolerance level provided.</p>\n",
